        "materials": [
          {
            "type": "CustomEntry",
            "epId": 324,
            "name": "Kutup Kurdunun Süt Dişi",
            "desc": "Weapon Ascension Material.<br/>Andrius' wolf pack is its blessed honor guard, and even the milk teeth of a wolf cub possess great potential.<br/>In the past, the gods had the responsibility to love all people. Andrius was therefore quite unusual in that he became leader of the wolves, while only welcoming abandoned babies and wanderers when it came to humans.",
            "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Boreal Wolf's Milk Tooth_icon.png",
            "amount": 1
          },
          {
            "type": "CustomEntry",
            "epId": 440,
            "name": "Kuru Ley Hattı Dalı",
            "desc": "Fragile branches from deep within the earth. Even after years of aging, from beneath it&#39;s mottled surface you can see that its power is not yet entirely lost.",
            "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Dead Ley Line Branch_icon.png",
            "amount": 1
          },
          {
            "type": "CustomEntry",
            "epId": 629,
            "name": "Hazine Avcısı Nişanı",
            "desc": "A signet that proudly represents its owner&#39;s position as member of the Treasure Hoarders. The pursuit of treasure knows no bounds. That said... Is being a thief something to be proud of?",
